cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CICADAS in your work, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "CICADAS: A Simulation-Based Framework for Randomized Trial Emulation in Critical-Care Seizure Treatment"
abstract: >-
  CICADAS integrates pharmacokinetic–pharmacodynamic modeling, disease-dynamics
  models, and the parametric g-formula to emulate randomized trials from
  observational ICU data with time-varying treatment–confounder feedback.
  This repository contains the MATLAB implementation (authoritative, used to
  generate the paper's figures) and a parallel Python port.
type: software
